{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"evadible-ambitious-canary","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\nBug tickets carry no record of WHICH detection channel found them (canary, CI, review bot, human audit, user report), so escape-channel trends are unmeasurable. Retroactive classification was rejected (unreliable); capture must happen at creation with zero added user friction.\n\n## Approach\nAutomated filers set an environment variable (e.g. REBAR_DETECTED_BY=canary|ci|review-bot) that 'rebar create' reads and stamps into the create event; scales to client projects because the filer owns its own env. Human/agent sources may pass an OPTIONAL '--detected-by <source>' flag; absent both, the field is simply unset (never required, never prompted). Document the flag in agent guidance and the bug-creation contract (see canary-hardening sibling).\n\n## Scope\n- src/rebar/_commands/create.py (or the create command module): read env var + optional flag\n- event schema: optional detected_by field on create events (additive, reducer-tolerated)\n- docs: config/env-vars registry entry + agent guidance line\n\n## Testing\nHappy path: env var set -> field present in event and shown by 'rebar show'. Flag overrides env. Edge: neither set -> field absent, create unchanged; invalid/empty value -> rejected or normalized, create still succeeds (never blocks filing).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] REBAR_DETECTED_BY env var stamps detected_by on created tickets; --detected-by flag overrides; absence changes nothing.\n- [ ] Field is additive: existing stores/reducers tolerate events without it; no migration required.\n- [ ] Registered in the env-var/docs registry so the drift gate covers it.\n- [ ] Tests cover env, flag, absence, and precedence.","id":"d3ed-88e3-86a3-4918","parent_id":"2f4c-7e5c-e782-4e97","priority":2,"tags":["bug-trends"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"detected-by capture at bug creation (env var for automation, optional flag for agents)"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785639947630519001,"uuid":"d0be519c-efdd-4e13-8794-79c5865ef434"}